    "title": "Woman Found Dead, Man Hospitalized After Overnight Search at Pyramid Mountain in Montville - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Karen Whitaker ,\n11 hours ago A woman was pronounced dead and her companion was taken to hospital following a multi-agency search at Pyramid Mountain in Montville Township, according to NBC New York. Virginia Taetzch, 87, and John Higgins, 77, had both gone missing Sunday after visiting the park. Police launched the search late Monday night... Read full article",
